 try absorbing American roots music from Chicago’s famed Maxwell Street t
 o New Orleans\, the cradle of the blues. He settled in Washington\, D.C. i
 n 1988 and quickly established a vibrant fan base. He has extensively tour
 ed Russia and Ukraine and was signed to Qualified Records as an artist in 
 2022
